# <type>[scope]: <subject>  <- imperative, lowercase, no period, <= 50 chars
#
# Why this change is needed (skip if obvious). What was the alternative?
# Wrap at 72.
#
# Refs / breaking-change footers if any:
# BREAKING CHANGE: ...
# Refs: #123
#
# ----- types -----
# feat      new feature for the user
# fix       bug fix for the user
# docs      docs only
# refactor  code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
# test      adding or fixing tests
# chore     tooling, deps, repo maintenance
# ci        CI/build pipeline
# perf      performance improvement
# build     build system or external dep changes
#
# ----- rules -----
# - one concern per commit; if the subject can't cover it, split
# - source + tests together; refactors separate from the feature
# - never commit broken main; WIP only on feature branches
# - no AI-author trailers, no marketing prose, no emoji
